[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0009","text":"摄影师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0010","text":"摩美美酱，要笑容满面～！\n再稍微拿出点偶像的感觉来～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0020","text":"对对！\n很有偶像范儿，很好～！就要那种感觉！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0023","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0030","text":"拍摄顺利结束了\n辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0040","text":"制作人……\n所谓的偶像范儿，到底是什么呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0050","text":"偶像范儿？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0060","text":"不只是那个\n大家都想把别人塞进框框里，或者定下各种规则……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0070","text":"“应该这样”这种事\n我可不太想被人规定呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0080","text":"摩美美……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0090","text":"白也好黑也好都被定死了\n不觉得太拘束了吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20500400_02_0100","text":"是啊……"}]
